        "id": 843,
        "name": "Rayman 2: The Great Escape",
        "summary": "With its enchanted storybook look beautifully translated into 3D, lush, vibrant colors, funny enemy designs, and clever jumping puzzles, Rayman 2 is platforming perfection. No arms, no legs, no problem for the little French creation that could.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_small/co81im.jpg",
