      {
        "id": 3585,
        "name": "Re-Volt",
        "summary": "Re-Volt is an R/C car racing game from Acclaim, originally released in 1999.\nRe-Volt features great gameplay, realistic physics that still hold up to this day and bright and colorful visuals. It's a game aimed at people who just want to play a funky arcade racing game as well as for people who seek a more competitive challenge. It's meant for all ages and occasions: Play for yourself or in the local network with friends, or even online!",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_small/co1n29.jpg",
