        "summary": "\"On the week before her daughter's birthday, Vanilla wonders how to surprise her daughter this year. The answer? Rent a huge castle, redecorate it and have a bit of fun\"\n\nA visual and audio overhaul of SM64 starring Cream & Cheese, by Gamebun. Nearly every enemy remodeled, the majority of the music has been changed and new voice lines and dialog.",
