      {
        "id": 215166,
        "name": "Ztar Attack: Mario Escape from the Jail - Definitive Edition",
        "summary": "Mario: Escape from the Jail - Definitive Edition is a ROM hack which contains 5 main courses and several side courses to explore and 50 collectable stars. This hack is a remaster of the original Escape from the Jail, made in 2016. This marks the second hack contributed in remaking a game of the Ztar Attack series, as well as the third game not made by the original creator (the first being Forest Ruins: Rebooted; the second being Ztar Attack Rebooted).\n\nFollowing the story, this game unfolds as a prequel to Ztar Attack under the brand \"Ztar Attack 0.5\". Unlike Ztar Attack Rebooted, the game uses the original level layout but key sections are condensed by quality standards -- visuals and exploration alike. Plus, newer gameplay tech and custom assets are implemented.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_small/co5cbc.jpg",
