      {
        "id": 259926,
        "name": "Super Luigi 64: The Flower Cup",
        "summary": "This is a 166-star romhack of Super Mario 64 about a visit to a small town, where Luigi finds himself the main rogue in a murder! He must follow the shadow to a strange fortress, one he recognizes vaguely. Through the various paintings created in front of him, Luigi must escape the fortress to solve the mystery, catch the culprit, and?\n\nThis is the sequel/remake to Luigi & The Violet Stars. This does not invalidate Violet Stars at all.",
