      {
        "id": 260804,
        "name": "Star Revenge 6: Luigi's Adventure",
        "summary": "A 121 star long sm64 hack with all 15 main courses and the overworld replaced with new levels. Simple story, Bowser just took once again over the castle and made new paintings for the stars.\nThe difficulty begins easy/normal and gets harder to the end.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_small/co6wte.jpg",
