      },
      {
        "id": 260806,
        "name": "Star Revenge 5: Neo Blue Realm",
        "summary": "This is the 5th of the \"Star Revenge\" Series of SM64 hacks. Not directly visable in the name but this is a remake of SR0.5 UL. The 7 main courses share the same theme with the old hack, but the models itself differ a lot.\n\nFor the most part you play as Mario and find yourself in front of a Castle after being send away by a trap in the past. There are 70 stars to find which are mostly easy but some hidden stuff here and there to explore with 3 different endings to this hack.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_small/co6wtg.jpg",
        "release_date": 1482710400,
        "rating": null,
        "rating_count": null,
        "genres": "Platform",
        "platform_ids": "4",
        "external_url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/star-revenge-5-neo-blue-realm",
        "cached_at": 1772526105
      },
      {
        "id": 260807,
        "name": "Star Revenge 0.5: The Unused Levels",
        "summary": "This is the 0.5th in the \"Star Revenge\" Series of SM64 hacks. Going by the name, this hack is based on levels made before SR1 and SR2.\n\nThe 7 main courses of this hack aren't too complex and are from the times before work on SR1 was restarted because of the release of bigger level patches. The cap switch levels are based on the TTM demo levels, which were made before SR2 NoD was started.\n\nThe hack has 65 stars and isn't too hard. Also a \"feature\" of this update is that you will find a lot of owo and uwu in star names. Why? Because why not.\n\nThere is also the remake of this hack called \"Star Revenge 5: Neo Blue Realm\" which is better than this hack.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_small/co6wth.jpg",
        "release_date": 1397088000,
        "rating": null,
        "rating_count": null,
        "genres": "Platform",
        "platform_ids": "4",
        "external_url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/star-revenge-0-dot-5-the-unused-levels",
        "cached_at": 1772526105
      },
      {
        "id": 260827,
        "name": "Star Revenge 6.5: Wrath of the Dim. Flower",
        "summary": "This is the 6.5th in the \"Star Revenge\" Series of SM64 hacks.\nThis hack is based around the idea of the green stars missions of Super Mario Galaxy 2. It also remixes the original stages of SR6 LA into new ones to make it more interesting and not feel the complete same.\n\nIn this hack you play again as Luigi like SR6, but this time the paintings inside of Peach's Castle are getting messed up by a huge flower that appeared out of nowhere outside of the castle. You can find 9 main courses in this hack + 2 boss levels.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_small/co6wu2.jpg",
        "release_date": 1406851200,
        "rating": null,
        "rating_count": null,
        "genres": "Platform",
        "platform_ids": "4",
        "external_url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/star-revenge-6-dot-5-wrath-of-the-dim-flower",
        "cached_at": 1772526105
      },
      {
        "id": 260828,
        "name": "Star Revenge 3.9: Dreamish Block Beats",
        "summary": "This is the 3.9th in the \"Star Revenge\" Series of SM64 hacks. Unlike all the other Star Revenges, this hack's 8 main levels are all 2.5D and themed around the beat blocks found in SR3.5.\n\nThe hack is split into 2 difficulties:\nNormal mode, which has checkpoints in all levels to save your progress and Hard mode, which removes all the checkpoints.\n\nHard mode can be unlocked once you master all 8 levels once.\nIf you want to just beat the hack, you can do once you got 8 stars, you are not forced to do anything on hard.\nDoing levels checkpointless is more for dare devils that would try to do it anyway, so it got added into the game.\n\nSince the camera can be limited, the hack comes with screenshoots of the levels so you can plan/see ahead what comes next in the level if needed.\n\nThis hack can be pretty hard, even on normal, but it's more a thing of getting the timing down. That said, course 8 is no joke tho.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_small/co6wu3.jpg",
        "release_date": 1548374400,
        "rating": null,
        "rating_count": null,
        "genres": "Platform",
        "platform_ids": "4",
        "external_url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/star-revenge-3-dot-9-dreamish-block-beats",
        "cached_at": 1772526105
      },
      {
        "id": 260829,
        "name": "Star Revenge 4.5: The Kedama Takeover Rewritten",
        "summary": "This is the 4.5th in the \"Star Revenge\" Series of SM64 hacks. Probably noticable by the Rewritten at the end of the name, this hack is a remake of SR4. 95% of the levels were made with completely new level models, which were made with the original design of the levels in mind to improve upon them.\n\nThis hack has 100 stars and is made in the open world style, which means that you access very few levels via an overworld and rather go from level to level via entrances in the levels itself. There is still an overworld which acts as a place for shortcuts to later levels if a game over happens.\n\nYou can find 15 new main courses and some side levels.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_small/co6wu6.jpg",
        "release_date": 1474588800,
        "rating": null,
        "rating_count": null,
        "genres": "Platform",
        "platform_ids": "4",
        "external_url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/star-revenge-4-dot-5-the-kedama-takeover-rewritten",
        "cached_at": 1772526105
      },
      {
        "id": 260835,
        "name": "Servus 64",
        "summary": "A Classic-Based Hack, heavily inspired by LUGMILLORD's SM74 and SM74EE.\n\nYour friend lost their wallet in this World. Because he is busy, you have to find and retrieve it for them. It's of great urgency, they might not attend to a Pizza Dinner without it! Will you be able to save it?\n\nFeatures:\n-141 Stars to collect (110 to Final Bowser)\n-aglab2 cam patch\n-Custom Bowser Fights (No ASM)\n-some Custom Music\n-mostly Vanilla Textured Levels\n-Bonus Area\n\nThe Hack starts with basic difficulty (first levels like SM74), and then gets increasingly harder till the end (last levels like SM74EE).\n\nGood luck and enjoy! :)",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_small/co6wus.jpg",
        "release_date": 1646697600,
        "rating": null,
        "rating_count": null,
        "genres": "Platform",
        "platform_ids": "4",
        "external_url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/servus-64",
        "cached_at": 1772526105
      },
      {
        "id": 260836,
        "name": "Super Mario: The Power Star Journey",
        "summary": "A complete major sm64 hack, \"Super Mario-The Power Star Journey\" brings you a new adventure for Mario to enjoy!\nThis hack features:\n-97 stars\n-25 new worlds to explore\n-variable difficulty with some tough moments\n-new music that fit the mood & environment\n-A new story!\n\nTexts are important since some really give clues to mysteries of the game...\nThe Readme file is important because it has my youtube channel, & also CRUCIAL because for players with no youtube accounts, the Readme has my E-mail so anyone can reach me...\n\nCan Mario save the King Star & return peace to Mushroom Kingdom once more?\n\nENJOY THE GAME!!!",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_small/coa4zz.jpg",
        "release_date": 1351468800,
