      {
        "id": 268691,
        "name": "OverKart 64",
        "summary": "OverKart 64 is a rom hack for Mario Kart 64 that provides new custom levels as well as several new features to enhance the original game. It is compatible with the Nintendo 64 hardware, provided a user has inserted the Expansion Pak.\nNew Game Modes:\n\n- \"Red Coin Mode\" where there are 8 red coins to be found and collected on each custom level.\n\n- \"Practice Mode\" which allows users to more easily practice the game with toggles on the D-Pad and L button such as save states and timers.\n\n- \"Flycam\" where you can control a free-floating camera that can navigate any of the original or custom levels.\n\nAs well as other options such as AI Bots, new racer stats, input display and much more.\n\nThe latest update (titled OverKart 4 DLC Pak) brings the number of custom levels to 24!",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_small/co7mth.jpg",
