      {
        "id": 313089,
        "name": "The Patchmaker's Workshop",
        "summary": "\"One day, whilst crafting a plush doll, something miraculous occured.\nThe doll smiled at me.\"\n\nMario awakes inside a charming workshop with a dark past, with Peach and Bowser transformed into plush dolls sitting beside him.\nThey had all been attacked by a man named The Patchmaker... To save them, he needs to team up with a creation of that man, the living doll Sewnia.\nEmbark across 12 different worlds, collecting a new ability in each that helps Mario traverse that area.\nWhat secrets does this workshop hold? What goals does The Patchmaker have?\n...And how did Sewnia come to life exactly?\n\nThe Patchmaker's Workshop features a fully original soundtrack composed by ornevelder, Tori Draws Stuff, and CowQuack.",
