        "summary": "Originally made for the \"SimpleFlips' Slide Hack Competition (2024)\", \"Super Mario and the Treacherous Tower\" is a Rom Hack by MrComit the creator of \"Super Mario and the Monstrous Manor\".\n\nIn this Hack, Mario is tasked by Princess Peach to investigate a haunted tower in the middle of nowhere, which is the source for paranormal activities in the Mushroom Kingdom.\nNow, Mario has to slide down each floor of the tower to track down the paranormal activity.",
