        "summary": "After releasing highly acclaimed cartridge music albums for the Sega Genesis, SNES, PC Engine and Game Boy, the German musician Remute is now once again coming up with a true novelty: 'R64' is the first ever music album released as a Nintendo 64 cartridge!\nIt is Remute's most diverse and playful album so far and contains 15 brand new songs ranging from ultra-catchy electro-pop reminiscent of Yello, Kraftwerk, or Yellow Magic Orchestra to sinister techno and house excursions beaming you right back to foggy 90s warehouse raves.",
