      {
        "id": 374679,
        "name": "Mario Kart 64 ITEM BLAST",
        "summary": "Item Blast\n\nThis is Mario Kart 64 mod with modern mechanics and all-new items inspired by later Mario Kart games.\nExperience the original N64 chaos — but now with smarter CPUs, new power-ups, and reworked balance.\n\nNEW ITEMS\n\nMega Mushroom\nGrow to a massive size and squish everything on your way!\nPerfect for breaking through traffic or revenge.\n\nPOW Block\nShake the race!\nUse it to slow down opponents and stop overtakes or even cancel some obstacles.\n\nFeather\nPerform incredible shortcuts and jumps, or use it to dodge shells, hazards, and traps.\n\nBullet Bill\nActivate to blast to the first place at max speed — automatic and unstoppable!\n\nNEW UI INTERFACE\nA redesigned user interface brings a fresh look while keeping the nostalgic MK64 feeling.\n\nSMART CPU\nThe CPU now:\n\nUses all available items, including new ones.\n\nCan evade items or shortcut using the Feather and Pow.\n\nFeatures an improved rubberband AI, driving smoother but still vulnerable to hazards.\nGet ready for a much more competitive experience!\n\nNEW BGM\nEnjoy over 20 new songs from different Nintendo titles!\nEnable them by pressing Z on the Game Selector screen.\n\nMORE ABOUT THE MOD IN THE GUIDE/BOOKLET!",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_small/coaq1k.jpg",
        "release_date": 1760918400,
        "rating": null,
        "rating_count": null,
        "genres": "Racing",
        "platform_ids": "4",
        "external_url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/mario-kart-64-item-blast",
        "cached_at": 1772526105
